{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日下午5時45分《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》紅地氈環節於將軍澳電視廣播城正式揭幕，台前幕後傾巢而出慶祝電視台邁 …</p><p></p>\n<p>今日下午5時45分《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》紅地氈環節於將軍澳電視廣播城正式揭幕，台前幕後傾巢而出慶祝電視台邁向59周年。平日穿梭全港十八區採訪《東張西望》主持團隊暫別密實採訪服，多位新生代小花換上華麗晚裝強勢踏上紅地氈。其中3位焦點女神激罕展現與別不同致命魅力，超大膽性感造型瞬間成為全場傳媒瘋狂捕捉焦點。</p>\n<h2>梁敏巧鄧凱文台慶紅地氈激罕爭妍鬥麗</h2>\n<p>梁敏巧以充滿健康肉感晚裝造型閃耀登場，並與李芷晴等藝人並肩同行，盡顯美好身段與團隊默契。鄧凱文亦毫不吝嗇豐滿身材，身穿淺色閃亮超低胸吊帶晚裝出戰，頸上配襯一條奪目紅色寶石頸飾，高貴之餘極具視覺衝擊力，讓現場氣氛瞬間沸騰。</p>\n<h2>鍾翠詩</h2>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454396842383_20789753946afed10075914.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (40).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454396842383_20789753946afed10075914.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>鄧凱文</h2>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454531671465_11342003686afed101be6e4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (39).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454531671465_11342003686afed101be6e4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>梁敏巧</h2>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454694916250_9724066836afed1038095f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (41).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454694916250_9724066836afed1038095f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>黎寬怡</h2>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454828569364_14490511986afed104a1e30.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (38).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454828569364_14490511986afed104a1e30.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>王汛文</h2>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454952071663_7049201016afed105dff04.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (37).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508454952071663_7049201016afed105dff04.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>王嘉慧</h2>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508455054684380_15038248136afed106e31bc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (36).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508455054684380_15038248136afed106e31bc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>陳欣庭</h2>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508455184476426_21025953936afed108329ce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (35).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179508455184476426_21025953936afed108329ce.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e5%bc%b5%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東張女神</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e5%bc%b5%e8%a5%bf%e6%9c%9b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東張西望</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%90%ac%e5%8d%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bc%9d%e8%b3%80%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b62026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬千星輝賀台慶2026</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3546024\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 19 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:56:44.560551+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":802,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:35:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:38.791180+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:50:09.929162+00:00","content_hash":"e6a2cc485fa7e2403792ea958c2c08056eda185de9130796411d8584a12ee595","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}